OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charge after man killed in
OL,4,Agroup attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 26-year-old man has been charged with
OL,7,Fthe murder of Rahiem Jackson in Leeds.
OL,9,FWest Yorkshire Police said Rahiem,
OL,10,Fknown as Reema, was attacked on Hedley
OL,11,FChase in New Wortley on Saturday 24
OL,12,FOctober by a group of men armed with
OL,13,Fweapons.
OL,15,FMichael Gyedu, of Rathmell Road, Leeds,
OL,16,Fhas been charged with murder and is due
OL,17,Fto appear before Leeds Magistrates'
OL,18,FCourt later.
OL,20,FPolice said a second 26-year-old man
OL,21,Fwas arrested on suspicion of murder on
OL,22,FSunday and remained in police custody.
